# Link Target

The notebook other notebooks link into.

## Alpha

The first section.

## Not A Heading Below

The next heading sits inside a fenced block, so it is not a section and
`#fenced-heading` must not resolve to it:

```markdown
## Fenced Heading
```

## The `fetch` API, really?

A heading with markup and punctuation in it. Its anchor is
`#the-fetch-api-really`.

